<article class="env-lemma" id="0FTQ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FTQ">Lemma <span data-tag="0FTQ">24.29.3</span>.</a> Let $(\mathcal{C}, \mathcal{O})$ be a ringed site. Let $\mathcal{A}$, $\mathcal{B}$ be differential graded $\mathcal{O}$-algebras. Let $\mathcal{N}$ be a differential graded $(\mathcal{A}, \mathcal{B})$-bimodule. Then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  R\mathop{\mathcal{H}\! \mathit{om}}\nolimits _\mathcal {B}(\mathcal{N}, -) : D(\mathcal{B}, \text{d}) \longrightarrow D(\mathcal{A}, \text{d})  \]
</div>
  <p> is right adjoint to </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  - \otimes _\mathcal {A}^\mathbf {L} \mathcal{N} : D(\mathcal{A}, \text{d}) \longrightarrow D(\mathcal{B}, \text{d})  \]
</div>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows from Derived Categories, Lemma <a href="/tag/0FND" data-tag="0FND">13.30.1</a> and Lemma <a href="/tag/0FRS" data-tag="0FRS">24.17.3</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>